---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Discover Your Brand Archetype | YellowBrollyCo"
  description="A strong brand is more than a logo. Discover the personality, energy, and role your business plays using brand archetypes. Take our assessment."
>
  <!-- ===================== HERO ===================== -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[90vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1917 0%, #2a2520 40%, #211e1a 100%);">
    <!-- Warm ambient glow -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.04] blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/3 w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.03] blur-[100px]"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Typography -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-40 md:pb-24">
          <span class="inline-block text-yellow-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-8 scroll-fade-up">Brand Strategy</span>
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-[0.95] mb-8 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
            Discover the<br />
            <span class="text-yellow-primary">identity</span> behind<br />
            your brand
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-light-gray leading-relaxed max-w-xl scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
            A strong brand is more than a logo or colour palette. It's the personality, energy, and role your business plays in the lives of your customers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Floating illustration -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative hidden lg:flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="relative scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.35s;">
            <!-- Subtle circle backdrop -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 m-auto w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.06] blur-2xl"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/brand/creative-designer.png"
              alt="Creative designer with laptop and lightbulb - representing brand strategy"
              class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-md drop-shadow-2xl"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom fade into next section -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-dark-warm to-transparent"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== WHAT ARE ARCHETYPES ===================== -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-dark-warm relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative illustration: coffee person tucked into the corner -->
    <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-4 opacity-[0.08] w-64 pointer-events-none">
      <img src="/images/brand/coffee-person.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-full" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
        <!-- Left column: intro text -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 scroll-fade-up">
          <span class="text-yellow-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 block">The Framework</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-[1.05] mb-6">
            Characters that<br />shape culture
          </h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-yellow-primary/40 mb-8"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right column: explanation -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Brand archetypes are a strategic framework based on universal character patterns first explored by psychologist Carl Jung. These patterns appear across cultures and stories because they reflect how people naturally understand identity and meaning.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray leading-relaxed">
            When applied to branding, archetypes help define how your brand should show up in the world: its voice, personality, values, and the emotional connection it builds with its audience.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray/60 mt-8 italic">
            That's why we use brand archetypes as part of our branding process.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== ARCHETYPE GRID ===================== -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-dark relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative: creative thinker floating top-right -->
    <div class="absolute -top-6 right-8 md:right-16 w-40 md:w-56 opacity-[0.07] pointer-events-none">
      <img src="/images/brand/creative-thinker.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-full" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <!-- Decorative: thumbs-up floating bottom-left -->
    <div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-8 md:left-20 w-36 md:w-48 opacity-[0.06] pointer-events-none">
      <img src="/images/brand/thumbs-up.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-full" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
      <!-- Section header -->
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16 scroll-fade-up">
        <span class="text-yellow-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 block">12 Universal Patterns</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-[1.05]">
          Meet the archetypes
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- 6-card grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.05s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#9876;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Mastery</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Hero</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Proves worth through courage and determination. Driven to make a difference.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Explorer -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#9978;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Freedom</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Explorer</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Seeks new experiences and authenticity. Refuses to be boxed in.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sage -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#128218;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Knowledge</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Sage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Uses intelligence and analysis to understand the world and share wisdom.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Caregiver -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#10084;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Service</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Caregiver</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Protects and nurtures others. Driven by compassion and generosity.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Creator -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.25s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#127912;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Innovation</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Creator</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Brings vision to life through imagination. Craves self-expression.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ruler -->
        <div class="group relative bg-dark-elevated/60 border border-dark-border/40 p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-yellow-primary/30 hover:bg-dark-elevated scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-5">
            <span class="text-3xl">&#128081;</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray/50 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Control</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">The Ruler</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray leading-relaxed">Creates order and structure. Leads with authority and responsibility.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray/50 mt-10 text-center scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.35s;">These are six of the twelve Jungian archetypes. Your brand's archetype is revealed through our assessment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== WHY IT MATTERS ===================== -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-dark-warm relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: editorial pull-quotes -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="scroll-fade-up mb-12">
            <span class="text-yellow-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 block">Why It Matters</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-[1.05] mb-4">
              A clear brand archetype<br />helps your business
            </h2>
            <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-yellow-primary/40"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Five editorial callouts -->
          <div class="space-y-0">
            <!-- Point 1 -->
            <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-dark-border/60 pl-8 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-yellow-primary/50 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.05s;">
              <span class="text-xs text-yellow-primary/70 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Identity</span>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white font-display leading-snug">Clarify its identity and positioning</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Know exactly who your brand is, what it stands for, and where it fits in the market.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Point 2 -->
            <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-dark-border/60 pl-8 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-yellow-primary/50 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
              <span class="text-xs text-yellow-primary/70 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Voice</span>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white font-display leading-snug">Create consistent messaging and tone of voice</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Every word, from your website to social posts, carries the same unmistakable personality.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Point 3 -->
            <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-dark-border/60 pl-8 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-yellow-primary/50 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
              <span class="text-xs text-yellow-primary/70 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Design</span>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white font-display leading-snug">Guide visual and design decisions</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Colours, typography, imagery, and layout all flow from one strategic foundation.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Point 4 -->
            <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-dark-border/60 pl-8 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-yellow-primary/50 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
              <span class="text-xs text-yellow-primary/70 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Connection</span>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white font-display leading-snug">Build stronger emotional connection with customers</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">People don't just buy products. They align with brands that mirror their own values.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Point 5 -->
            <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-dark-border/60 pl-8 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-yellow-primary/50 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.25s;">
              <span class="text-xs text-yellow-primary/70 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Differentiation</span>
              <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white font-display leading-snug">Stand out in competitive markets</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">When competitors all sound the same, an archetype gives you a distinct voice that cuts through.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-base text-gray mt-10 leading-relaxed pl-8 scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
            Instead of guessing how your brand should communicate, archetypes provide a clear foundation for everything that follows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: magnifying glass illustration -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-2 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
          <div class="relative scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 m-auto w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.05] blur-3xl"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/brand/magnifying-glass.png"
              alt="Magnifying glass illustration - examining your brand identity"
              class="relative z-10 w-64 md:w-80 lg:w-96 drop-shadow-2xl"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== QUIZ CTA ===================== -->
  <section class="relative py-24 md:py-36 overflow-hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2a2520 0%, #211e1a 50%, #1c1917 100%);">
    <!-- Ambient glow -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.04] blur-[150px]"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Left: trophy illustration -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <div class="relative scroll-fade-up">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 m-auto w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-yellow-primary/[0.06] blur-2xl"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/brand/trophy-winner.png"
              alt="Person celebrating with trophy - discover your brand archetype"
              class="relative z-10 w-56 md:w-72 drop-shadow-2xl"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: CTA content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 lg:pl-8">
          <div class="scroll-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
            <span class="text-yellow-primary text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-6 block">Ready to find out?</span>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-[0.95] mb-8">
              Take the Brand<br />
              Archetype Quiz
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-12">
              Our Brand Archetype assessment helps uncover the deeper personality of your brand and provides insight into how your business should communicate, connect, and grow.
            </p>

            <!-- TODO: Quiz destination needs to be confirmed with the client. Currently links to contact page as placeholder. -->
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-yellow-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black overflow-hidden group bg-yellow-primary text-black hover:bg-yellow-hover px-12 py-5 text-base"
            >
              <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3">
                Start the Quiz
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg>
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
